'''Plastik Salyan FK''' ({{langx|az|Plastik Salyan Futbol Klubu}}) was an [[Azerbaijan]]i [[football (soccer)|football]] club from [[Salyan, Azerbaijan|Salyan]] founded in 1971,<ref>{{cite web|title=Azerbaijan&nbsp;– List of Foundation Dates|url=https://www.rsssf.org/tablesa/azerfound.html|publisher= The Rec.Sport.Soccer Statistics Foundation|accessdate=3 January 2014}}</ref> as ''Himik Salyan''. They changed their name to ''Plastik Salyan'' in 1990 before disbanding in 1997."}}
